    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear what you're saying, but it's hard to believe in resilience when you're just waiting for the next thing to break you. it feels like a cycle that never ends. honestly, it feels more like some things are just meant to stay broken. like, maybe some damage is just permanent, and there's no point in keeping up the fight if the outcome is always going to be the same.",
